caption: Step 2: Select the Shared Modifiers
technology-rule: step-2-select-the-shared-modifiers

Apply enhancements and limitations to the package.

All integrated effects must share the same chem-level modifiers, including:

Duration

Backlash

Temporary Disadvantages

Accessibility

Unreliability

Triggering conditions

Activation requirements

A modifier intrinsic to one trait may still apply only to that trait. For example, DR might have Tough Skin while another advantage in the package does not. Such a modifier cannot give that component a separate duration, onset, or crash.

As normal in GURPS, net limitations cannot reduce a trait below 20% of its unmodified value.
